    {
      "argv": [],
      "error_kind": "NoArgsIsHelpError",
      "error_message": "\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502 \u273b agentcage v{VERSION}                        \u2502\n\u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256f\n\nUsage: agentcage [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...\n\n  Defense-in-depth proxy sandbox for AI agents.\n\nOptions:\n  --version  Show the version and exit.\n  --help     Show this message and exit.\n\nCommands:\n  cage      Manage cages.\n  doctor    Check system health and diagnose common issues.\n  domain    Manage cage domain filters.\n  init      Scaffold a new agentcage config file.\n  scaffold  Create and manage custom scaffolds.\n  secret    Manage cage-scoped secrets.\n  watcher   Read the traffic watcher's findings and scan status.\n\nAliases:\n  config \u2192 cage edit\n  delete \u2192 cage destroy\n  describe \u2192 cage show\n  edit \u2192 cage edit\n  exec \u2192 cage exec\n  inspect \u2192 cage show\n  logs \u2192 cage logs\n  ls \u2192 cage list\n  ps \u2192 cage list\n  reload \u2192 cage restart\n  restart \u2192 cage restart\n  rm \u2192 cage destroy\n  run \u2192 cage run\n  shell \u2192 cage shell\n  show \u2192 cage show\n  start \u2192 cage start\n  status \u2192 cage status\n  stop \u2192 cage stop\n  update \u2192 cage update",
      "exit_code": 2,
      "frames": [],
      "outcome": "error"
