      "error_message": "Usage: agentcage cage [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...\n\n  Manage cages.\n\nOptions:\n  --help  Show this message and exit.\n\nCommands:\n  audit    Query, filter, and summarize proxy audit logs.\n  backup   Create a backup tarball of a cage.\n  create   Build images, generate quadlets, install, and start a new cage.\n  destroy  Stop containers, remove quadlets, state, and scoped secrets.\n  edit     Edit a cage's stored config in $EDITOR, with validation and safe...\n  exec     Run a command inside a cage container.\n  grants   Manage Policy API runtime domain grants (see...\n  har      Export captured HTTP traffic as HAR 1.2 JSON.\n  list     List all cages with status.\n  logs     Show journalctl logs for a cage.\n  prune    Remove all exited interactive and ephemeral cages.\n  restart  Restart services without rebuilding images.\n  restore  Restore a cage from a backup tarball.\n  run      Run a coding agent in a sandboxed cage.\n  shell    Open an interactive shell in a cage container.\n  show     Show cage configuration and status.\n  start    Start a stopped cage.\n  status   Show status \u2014 one cage's detail (with NAME) or all cages (without).\n  stop     Stop a running cage without destroying it.\n  update   Rebuild and restart an existing cage.\n  verify   Check that a cage is healthy.\n\nAliases:\n  config \u2192 edit\n  delete \u2192 destroy\n  describe \u2192 show\n  inspect \u2192 show\n  ls \u2192 list\n  ps \u2192 list\n  reload \u2192 restart\n  rm \u2192 destroy",
